PLANNING AND CARRYING OUT WORK\
\
What a person experiences\
\
Tasks supports parent tasks, smaller steps, status and priority changes, deletion,\
assistant-generated breakdowns, and locally run automation. Deck Maker turns an idea\
into a task with smaller actions. Briizify combines tasks, Forest material, or pasted text\
into a focus plan and can place its activities on the calendar.\
\
Organizer stores projects, events, ideas, notes, and timers. Calendar displays planning\
items and scheduled appearances of tasks. The day planner can propose placements and focus\
blocks. Priorifact is the live form of a Briizify focus plan. It follows the clock, shows\
the current activity and remaining time, reveals preparation, steps, or support notes,\
and can pause or extend the plan. Its expanded view can add, edit, reorder, or remove\
activities and breaks. It can also place the plan on Calendar or save it as a reusable\
flow.\
\
Forest is the visual project field. It displays project cards and files, searches project\
material, finds missing or changed files, opens files, and can gather project files into a\
chosen location.\
\
What makes it work\
\
The planning surfaces call local task, organizer, placement, automation, and Forest\
operations through the bridge. Their information is portable to a new shell.\
\
Forest is a real technical exception. It is an older non-React application whose script\
expects particular document elements and installs global browser listeners. Its React host\
creates and tears down that isolated environment. The first ambient version should host\
Forest whole inside a shared window rather than mixing a Forest rewrite into the shell\
redesign.\
\
Phantom is also an exception because its current surface starts an external Python\
application at one hardcoded machine path. Phantom itself is an active Tasks workflow,\
not a later idea. Preserve its list, playback, record, inspect, run, status, stop, and\
delete actions. Replace the hardcoded path with a local Integration setting and a folder\
picker. Import the present path into that setting if it exists; otherwise show Select\
Phantom Folder. Keep the external Python application separate because it is another\
program, while keeping its visible controls in the Planning section of workspace.jsx.\
\
