APPLICATION CONTROL, SETTINGS, AND THEMES\
\
What a person experiences\
\
The current control surface includes launcher ordering and appearance; time, date, and\
weather; model and credential configuration; Briizy settings; integrations; assistant\
memory; permissions; system health; appearance editing; theme libraries; and login or\
offline entry.\
\
What makes it work\
\
ControlBar has separate launch and active-state wiring for every current surface type.\
Dashboard contains the settings areas. ThemeProvider, its registry, its runtime, and Theme\
Studio together support broad global styling, component-specific styling, individual\
object overrides, live object selection, saved libraries, import, export, duplicate,\
rename, Save As, delete, revert, undo, redo, palette generation, Replace Default, and\
Restore Default.\
\
The feature list is valuable. The surface-specific launcher wiring and selector-by-selector\
theme machinery should not survive the recast.\
