Use this conversion rather than inventing one during implementation:\
\
- old canvas becomes ambient desktop background;\
- old panel becomes window surface;\
- old elevated becomes raised surface;\
- old textStrong or textPrimary becomes strong text;\
- old textSoft or textMuted becomes quiet text;\
- old primary becomes primary emphasis;\
- old secondary becomes secondary emphasis;\
- old success, warning, and danger keep those same status jobs;\
- old border or borderStrong becomes the ordinary edge and focus edge;\
- old fontUi becomes body type and old fontDisplay becomes title type;\
- old glowStrength and shadowDepth become the restrained shared shadow strength;\
- old motionFast, motionNormal, and reducedMotion become shared motion and the reduced-motion\
  choice;\
- old panelRadius sets the overall amount of roundness while retaining v3's uneven main\
  window corner pattern;\
- the per-theme Conversation background and blur copy unchanged to the converted theme.\
