corner settings, masonry gaps, masonry header height, and instance overrides have no direct\
ambient equivalent. Keep them in the untouched backup and list their names in the theme's\
plain conversion notes. Use the v3-led default for the new visual job; do not translate an\
old value into an unrelated new role merely to avoid reporting it.\
