Readable body text, comfortable line lengths, clear group spacing, keyboard focus,\
reduced-motion preferences, and user zoom are part of completion. Critical actions are\
not hover-only. Icons are accompanied by text where recognition would otherwise depend on\
memory. Every asynchronous surface has understandable loading, empty, error, and success\
